Nacho: Yo, Sushi, you ever think about how weird it is that we just... exist?
Sushi: Huh? What do you mean, Nacho?
Nacho: Like, one moment there was nothing, and then boom! Here we are, just chillin’.
Sushi: I guess I never really thought about it that way.
Nacho: Right? It’s kinda mind-blowing when you think about it.
